---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout title="Contribute" description="Contribute to Varve: code, documentation, testing, and design. All contributions are welcome — the source is available on GitHub under FSL-1.1-MIT.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="contribute-page">
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">Contribute to Varve</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">
        Varve is community-shaped. Whether you contribute code, documentation, testing, or design, your help is valued and appreciated.
      </p>
      <p class="page-hero-sub" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Varve is not yet accepting external contributions.</strong> The page below describes the process we intend to use once the project opens up. In the meantime, feedback and ideas are welcome in <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/discussions">GitHub Discussions</a>.
      </p>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Ways to Contribute</h2>
        
        <div class="contribute-cards">
          <div class="contribute-card">
            <div class="cc-head">
              <div class="cc-icon cc-icon-teal" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Code Contributions</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Fix bugs, add features, improve performance</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Read the <a href={sitePath('/contribute/guidelines')}>contribution guidelines</a></li>
              <li>Set up development environment (see <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/blob/main/AGENTS.md">AGENTS.md</a>)</li>
              <li>Check for "good first issue" labels on GitHub</li>
              <li>Submit pull requests with tests</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contribute-card">
            <div class="cc-head">
              <div class="cc-icon cc-icon-sand" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/><path d="M10 9H8"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Documentation</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Improve docs, write tutorials, translate content</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Fix typos or clarify confusing sections</li>
              <li>Write tutorials for specific workflows</li>
              <li>Add examples and screenshots</li>
              <li>Translate documentation to other languages</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contribute-card">
            <div class="cc-head">
              <div class="cc-icon cc-icon-terra" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Testing</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Test on different platforms and report bugs</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Test on specific Linux distributions</li>
              <li>Test on different macOS versions</li>
              <li>Test accessibility with screen readers</li>
              <li>Verify bug fixes and report regressions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contribute-card">
            <div class="cc-head">
              <div class="cc-icon cc-icon-ink" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z"/><path d="m18 13-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z"/><path d="m2 2 7.586 7.586"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Design</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Create UI mockups, icons, website improvements</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Design new feature interfaces</li>
              <li>Create icon designs</li>
              <li>Improve website UX</li>
              <li>Design marketing materials</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Getting Started</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Read the <a href={sitePath('/contribute/guidelines')}>contribution guidelines</a> and code of conduct</li>
          <li>Set up your development environment following <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/blob/main/AGENTS.md">AGENTS.md</a></li>
          <li>Check existing issues for "good first issue" labels</li>
          <li>Fork the repository and create a feature branch</li>
          <li>Make your changes and add tests</li>
          <li>Submit a pull request with a clear description</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Contribution Licensing</h2>
        <p>
          Once open, all contributions to Varve will need to be licensed under FSL-1.1-MIT. By contributing, you will grant a license for your code to be included in the project under the same license. You retain copyright to your contributions.
        </p>
        <p>
          All contributions require a <a href="https://developercertificate.org/">Developer Certificate of Origin</a> (DCO) sign-off. See <a href={sitePath('/contribute/guidelines')}>the contribution guidelines</a> for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Recognition</h2>
        <p>
          Contributors are recognized in the following ways:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>GitHub contributor list (automatic)</li>
          <li>Release notes acknowledgment (with permission)</li>
          <li>Contributors section on the About page</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <div class="contribute-cta">
        <h2>Want to know when contributions open?</h2>
        <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/discussions" class="btn-primary">Follow GitHub Discussions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contribute-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .contribute-page .page-hero-title {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contribute-page .page-hero-sub {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contribute-page .page-hero-sub:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .contribute-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: border-color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-default);
  }

  .contribute-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  /* Icon + title as a flex row: icon cannot overlap the title at any
     zoom level, and the layout stays stable when titles wrap. */
  .cc-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cc-head .cc-icon {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .cc-head h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Icon + title sit side by side in a flex row — in normal flow, so the
     icon can never overlap the title at any font size, zoom, or reflow. */
  .cc-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .cc-icon {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .cc-icon-teal {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--brand-teal) 12%, var(--surface-card));
    color: var(--brand-teal);
  }

  .cc-icon-sand {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--brand-sandstone) 12%, var(--surface-card));
    color: var(--brand-sandstone);
  }

  .cc-icon-terra {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--brand-terracotta) 12%, var(--surface-card));
    color: var(--brand-terracotta);
  }

  .cc-icon-ink {
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .contribute-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  
  .contribute-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-card ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .contribute-card li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .contribute-card li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
  }
  
  .contribute-section ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: item;
  }
  
  .contribute-section ol li {
    counter-increment: item;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .contribute-section ol li::before {
    content: counter(item);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--status-built);
    color: var(--text-on-status);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .contribute-section ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .contribute-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .contribute-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
  }
  
  .contribute-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }
  
  .contribute-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
